debug.log

# the ledger: generated by scripts/ledger.mjs, and check results captured by scripts/capture-check.mjs.
# The raw run records stay out of the repo: they are 3.4 MB of one run's workings, and a clone that
# has not run the checks should say "not run yet", not show someone else's run as its own. What is
# committed instead is docs/release-snapshot.json: one line per model per check, written by
# scripts/release-snapshot.mjs, and shown by docs/ledger.html as the state at the last release.
/docs/ledger.json
/docs/checks/
/docs/ledger-watch.json
/docs/ledger-queue.json.lock
/docs/*.tmp
# fingerprints of every model at past commits (scripts/fingerprint.mjs): a cache
/.cache/
